 "title": "Four-line low-capacitance ESD and surge protection array, 5 V, TSOP-6",
 "source": {
  "document": "SRV05-4/D",
  "revision": "Rev. 4, October 2024",
  "pages": 11
 },
 "summary": "SRV05-4 puts four pairs of low-capacitance steering diodes and one surge-rated Zener in a TSOP-6 to guard four signal lines. The working voltage is 5 V, line capacitance is 3 pF typical to ground and 1.5 pF typical line to line, and the array is rated 300 W and 12 A for an 8 × 20 µs surge. With VP on a supply rail it also clamps that rail; with VP open the lines clamp against the internal Zener.",
 "key_figures": [
